Position: Verification Specialist
Status: Full-Time
FLSA Code: Non-Exempt 
About Us:
Verified First is a booming tech company on a mission to deliver cutting-edge technology transforming how organizations protect their people. As a constant recipient of the "Best Places to Work" award, you can be sure we'll invest in you as both a professional and a person. We're looking for people like you -- ambitious, hard-working, and fun -- to join our team! 
Summary:
The Verifications Specialist will serve as an extension of our team, verifying employment, education, professional references, and license status of job applicants for our clients.
How our Verifications Specialist spends their time:

Make outbound calls daily in the performance of education, employment, and reference verifications provided by job applicants on behalf of our clients;

Review and complete verification requests as ordered by our clients; 

Determine, through research, the next steps to verify information;

Answer inbound calls on a multi-line phone system for the Verifications Department;

Conduct internet research to verify education and employment information provided by job candidates;

Email businesses, schools, and professional organizations to verify information given by job applicants on behalf of our clients;

Conduct interviews with professional references to assess a job applicant's previous work history;

Meet team productivity and accuracy standards;

